      "answer": "One-hour station circuit: four stations (disassemble, clean/inspect, re-assemble, test/display) staffed by mixed-skill pairs. Objects travel with visible tags: \"Try\", \"Parts\", \"Display\". Table holds tools and spare fasteners. After each round, unfixable items move to communal parts bin. Safeguard: 30-minute cap per station; if stuck, object shifts to parts bin. Success metric: 70 % of participants report increased confidence on exit sticky note."
    },
