      "id": "B",
      "kind": "exploratory",
      "mechanism": "Two-phase drop-in: first phase, quick triage on sidewalk where neighbors vote \"Fix\" or \"Parts\" with colored dots, reducing decision paralysis. Second phase, only \"Fix\" objects move indoors. Pairs rotate every 15 minutes. Safeguard: any object untouched after two rotations automatically becomes parts. Success: count parts harvested vs objects discarded; target 1 kg of reusable hardware saved.",
