      "answer": "Skill-share ladder: skilled volunteers wear colored armbands and only intervene when asked. Novices start with simple tasks; armband holder coaches, then leaves. Unrepairable objects are photographed and logged as \"material resource\". Safeguard: no one works alone on electrical items. Success: photograph log shows ≥10 distinct parts reused in future neighborhood projects within one month."
    }
  ]
}

