      "answer": "Four-station circuit: label table sections Disassemble, Inspect, Try-Fix, and Parts. Each object moves on colored index card showing current stage. Mixed-skill pairs work 20 minutes per station then rotate clockwise. Any object still unfixed after full circuit enters Parts bin. Safeguard: red card rule—two people must agree before declaring an item unrepairable. Success metric: 60 % of participants keep at least one salvaged part for personal use, recorded by sticker tally on exit."
