      "mechanism": "Tiered start: newcomers pick one of five starter tasks printed on cards (clean screws, sort fasteners, test batteries, label parts, hold flashlight). After ten minutes they choose a second task or stay. Objects that receive no starter-task card within 30 minutes move to communal parts. Safeguard: battery tester is the only electrical tool; everything else hand-powered. Success: total weight of fasteners sorted into labeled jars at close of event.",
