      "kind": "exploratory",
      "mechanism": "Gallery pass: each repaired or partly repaired object is placed on the table with a single-sentence story card written by its last handler. Viewers vote with green dots for “inspire” or yellow dots for “harvest parts”. Objects reaching three yellow dots become parts immediately. Safeguard: story card must be present—no anonymous discards. Success: ratio of green to yellow dots overall exceeds 1:1, indicating net creative reuse.",
